INSERT INTO `craft_matrixcontent_pagecontent` VALUES (1,1087,'en_gb','How we work','<p>The opinions and ideas of such groups help us to change and improve the industry, promoting the importance of skills recognition, training and development with the aim of increasing productivity, sustainability - and ultimately profitability.</p>\r\n<p>Liaising closely with industries within the land-based sector we represent, along with governments, funding agencies, learning providers, trade associations and the media, we can shape important strategies for the future.</p>','2018-08-23 14:29:32','2018-12-07 10:17:14','0c1af4bb-0417-4094-b496-d1087fba4835'),(2,1088,'en_gb','Working with industry groups and employers','<p>At the heart of Lantra\'s organisation are environmental and land-based employers - experts in their own field who know first hand the requirements of their industries. Employers play an integral part in the corporate structure of the organisation from working groups through to Lantra\'s board of directors, and play a key leadership role in forming and shaping Lantra\'s strategies, products and services.</p>','2018-08-23 14:29:32','2018-12-07 10:17:14','9d2d10f7-8a24-4985-8996-dcae5bca2251'),(6,1620,'en_gb','','<p>You can send a direct contact to Lantra by completing this form. We will get back to you with our answer by either telephone or email, depending on which option that you chose. We aim to reply to all enquiries by the end of the next working day.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:Portia.Hartley@lantra.co.uk?subject=Testing\">Send us an email</a></p>','2018-11-23 11:08:56','2019-01-18 13:30:11','b3d1bacf-a47f-4f55-a3ef-a9e866036ade'),(12,3619,'en_gb','','<p>As part of our relationship with you as a member of Poultry Passport, Poultec Training Limited on behalf of British Poultry Training holds various types of data about you. This data includes, but may not be limited to, your first and last name, date of birth, home address, email address, record of your skills and/or training and/or CPD.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>Poultec Training Limited holds this data for legitimate business interests and to be able to provide you with the service of accessing and updating your record of skills and/or training and/or CPD.&nbsp; We will only use your personal data for this purpose. Your data will only be stored electronically. We will not use your data for marketing purposes and we do not undertake any profiling of your data. We will not share your personal data with any third parties outside of British Poultry Training, other than Lantra who is the data processor.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>Poultry Passport Data Controller is: Leroy Burrell who can be contacted on 01362 857197.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>You have various rights as a data subject under the General Data Protection Regulation which are set out fully on&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/guide-to-the-general-data-protection-regulation-gdpr/\">https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/guide-to-the-general-data-protection-regulation-gdpr/</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;but your key rights are:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul><li>Should Poultry Passport fail in our duty to protect your data, you have the right to lodge a complaint with the Information Commissioners Office (ICO).&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ico.org.uk/\">www.ico.org.uk</a></li><li>You have the right to request access to your personal data and Poultry Passport must comply within one month</li><li>You have the right to request erasure of your data, however in doing so this will delete all of your learning records. You request this by emailing&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:enquires@poultrypassport.org\">enquires@poultrypassport.org</a>&nbsp;who will delete your data within 20 working days</li><li>You have the right to have personal data rectified if it is inaccurate or incomplete. If we have disclosed your personal data to third parties, Poultry Passport must inform them and you of the rectification within one month</li></ul>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p><p><br></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"{asset:14870:url}\">Download File</a><br></p>','2019-03-01 09:38:45','2019-04-08 15:33:15','959bbbd5-b850-4810-8fef-096710fb63d0');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `craft_matrixcontent_pagecontent` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

